+- Focused regression tests executed in this container: 44 PASS, 0 FAIL. This group includes Settings draft/save behavior, product gallery/Manager inventory UX, branding authorization contracts, low-stock calculation contracts, lockfile/security metadata and translated grouped Manager navigation contracts.
+- Syntax: 192 JS/MJS files PASS. Static source/config audit: 87 files PASS, 1,828 aligned EN/CKB/AR/NL dictionary keys. Static EJS template audit: 46 templates PASS. CSS build PASS. Cloudflare source bundle PASS (46 templates). Release preflight PASS (86 production files).
