oducten →' : 'All products →') %></a></div><div class=\"product-grid product-grid-signature\"><% if (!products.length) { %><div class=\"home-empty-state\"><h3><%= pageText(\"Our collection is coming soon\") %></h3><p><%= pageText(\"Have a question? We are here to help.\") %></p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/contact\"><%= pageText(\"Contact us\") %> →</a></div><% } %><% products.forEach(p=>{ %><%- include('partials/product-card',{p:p}) %><% }) %></div></section>\n<section class=\"container trust-row trust-row-four\" aria-label=\"<%= pageText(locale==='ckb'?'زانیاریی کڕین':locale==='ar'?'معلومات التسوق':locale==='nl'?'Winkelen':'Shopping information') %>\">\n  <div><span class=\"trust-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌕</span><strong><%= pageText(locale==='ckb'?'گەڕانی ئاسان':locale==='ar'?'اكتشاف سهل':locale==='nl'?'Eenvoudig zoeken':'Easy discovery') %></strong><span><%= pageText(locale==='ckb'?'بەپێی ناو یان پۆل بگەڕێ.':locale==='ar'?'ابحث بالاسم أو تصفّح الفئات.':locale==='nl'?'Zoek op naam of bekijk de categorieën.':'Search by name or browse categories.') %></span></div>\n  <div><span class=\"trust-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span><strong><%= pageText(locale==='ckb'?'نرخی ڕوون':locale==='ar'?'أسعار واضحة':locale==='nl'?'Duidelijke prijzen':'Clear pricing') %></strong><span><%= pageText(locale==='ckb'?'پێش داواکردن نرخەکە ببینە.':locale==='ar'?'راجع السعر قبل الطلب.':locale==='nl'?'Bekijk de prijs voordat je bestelt.':'Review the price before ordering.') %></span></div>\n  <div><span class=\"trust-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▣</span><strong><%= pageText(locale==='ckb'?'پارەدان لە کاتی گەیاندن':locale==='ar'?'الدفع عند الاستلام':locale==='nl'?'Betalen bij levering':'Cash on delivery') %></strong><span><%= pageText(locale==='ckb'?'کاتێک داواکارییەکەت گەیشت پارە بدە.':locale==='ar'?'ادفع عند وصول طلبك.':locale==='nl'?'Betaal wanneer je bestelling aankomt.':'Pay when your order arrives.') %></span></div>\n  <a class=\"trust-item\" href=\"/shipping-returns\"><span class=\"trust-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↺</span><strong><%= pageText(locale==='ckb'?'سیاسەتی ڕوون':locale==='ar'?'سياسات واضحة':locale==='nl'?'Duidelijke voorwaarden':'Clear policies') %></strong><span><%= pageText(locale==='ckb'?'زانیاری گەیاندن و گەڕاندنەوە بخوێنەوە.':locale==='ar'?'راجع معلومات الشحن والإرجاع.':locale==='nl'?'Lees de informatie over verzending en retouren.':'Read shipping and return details before ordering.') %></span></a>\n</section>\n<% if (newProducts && newProducts.length) { %>\n<section id=\"new-arrivals\" class=\"container section new-arrivals-section\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= pageText(locale === 'ckb' ? 'تازە زیادکراوەکان' : locale === 'ar' ? 'أُضيفت حديثًا' : locale === 'nl' ? 'NIEUW TOEGEVOEGD' : 'JUST ADDED') %></span><h2><%= pageText(locale === 'ckb' ? 'بەرهەمی نوێ لە فرۆشگا' : locale === 'ar' ? 'أحدث المنتجات' : locale === 'nl' ? 'Nieuw in de winkel' : 'New in the shop') %></h2></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/shop?sort=newest\"><%= pageText(locale === 'ckb' ? 'هەموو بەرهەمەکان ←' : locale === 'ar' ? 'كل المنتجات ←' : locale === 'nl' ? 'Bekijk alle producten →' : 'See all products →') %></a></div><div class=\"product-grid product-grid-signature\"><% newProducts.forEach(p=>{ %><%- include('partials/product-card',{p:p}) %><% }) %></div></section>\n<% } %>\n\n<% if (aiEnabled) { %><section class=\"container section ai-card\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= pageText(\"OPTIONAL AI\") %></span><h2><%= pageText(locale==='nl'?'Hulp nodig bij het kiezen?':locale==='ckb'?'یارمەتی بۆ هەڵبژاردن؟':locale==='ar'?'هل تحتاج إلى مساعدة في الاختيار؟':'A little help choosing?') %></h2><p><%= pageText(locale==='nl'?'Stel een korte productvraag aan de winkelassistent.':locale==='ckb'?'پرسیارێکی کورت دەربارەی بەرهەمەکان بکە.':locale==='ar'?'اطرح سؤالًا قصيرًا عن منتجات المتجر.':'Ask a quick question about products in this store.') %></p></div><div class=\"ai-form\"><label for=\"ai-input\"><%= pageText(locale==='nl'?'Je vraag':locale==='ckb'?'پرسیارەکەت':locale==='ar'?'سؤالك':'Your question') %></label><div class=\"ai-input-row\"><input id=\"ai-input\" maxlength=\"500\" placeholder=\"<%= pageText(locale==='nl'?'Wat is handig voor dagelijks woon-werkverkeer?':locale==='ckb'?'کام بەرهەم بۆ بەکارهێنانی ڕۆژانە باشە؟':locale==='ar'?'ما المنتج المناسب للاستخدام اليومي؟':'What works well for daily travel?') %>\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-dark\" data-ai-ask><%= pageText(locale==='nl'?'Vraag':locale==='ckb'?'بپرسە':locale==='ar'?'اسأل':'Ask') %></button></div><p class=\"field-note\"><%= pageText(locale==='nl'?'Je vraag en maximaal 12 openbare productgegevens (naam, omschrijving, actuele verkoopprijs met winkelvaluta, verkoopbare voorraad na reserveringen en productslug) worden naar de ingestelde AI-provider gestuurd. Duidelijke e-mailadressen, telefoonnummers, IBAN-achtige waarden en herkenbare straatadressen worden verwijderd, maar niet alle persoonlijke gegevens kunnen automatisch worden herkend. Deel hier daarom nooit namen, adressen, contactgegevens, rekeningnummers, bestelgegevens, wachtwoorden of betaalgegevens. De externe AI-provider verwerkt de verzonden tekst volgens zijn eigen voorwaarden en bewaartermijn.':locale==='ckb'?'پرسیارەکەت و زۆرترین ١٢ زانیاریی گشتیی بەرهەم (ناو، وەسف، نرخی فرۆشتنی ئێستا بە دراوی فرۆشگا، بڕی فرۆشتنی بەردەست دوای لەبەرگرتنەوە و بەستەری بەرهەم) بۆ دابینکەری AI دەنێردرێن. ئیمەیڵی ئاشکرا، ژمارەی تەلەفۆن، IBAN ـی هاوشێوە و ناونیشانی شەقام کە بە ئاشکرایی بناسرێتەوە دەسڕدرێنەوە، بەڵام هەموو زانیارییە کەسییەکان ناناسێتەوە. ناو، ناونیشان، زانیاریی پەیوەندی، ژمارەی هەژمار، وردەکاریی داواکاری، وشەی نهێنی یان زانیاریی پارەدان مەنووسە. دابینکەری دەرەکی AI دەقە نێردراوەکان بە پێی مەرج و ماوەی هەڵگرتنی خۆی پرۆسێس دەکات.':locale==='ar'?'يُرسل سؤالك وما يصل إلى 12 حقلًا عامًا للمنتجات (الاسم والوصف وسعر البيع الحالي بعملة المتجر والكمية المتاحة للبيع بعد الحجوزات ومعرّف المنتج) إلى مزود الذكاء الاصطناعي المُعدّ. تُزال عناوين البريد الواضحة وأرقام الهواتف والقيم الشبيهة بـ IBAN وعناوين الشوارع التي يمكن التعرف عليها قبل الإرسال، لكن لا يمكن اكتشاف كل البيانات الشخصية تلقائيًا. لا تكتب أسماء أو عناوين أو معلومات اتصال أو أرقام حسابات أو تفاصيل طلبات أو كلمات مرور أو بيانات دفع. يعالج مزود الذكاء الاصطناعي الخارجي النص المرسل وفق شروطه وفترة الاحتفاظ الخاصة به.':'Your question and up to 12 public product fields (name, description, current selling price in the store currency, sellable stock after reservations and product slug) are sent to the configured AI provider. Obvious email addresses, phone numbers, IBAN-like values and recognizable street addresses are removed, but not all personal information can be detected automatically. Never enter names, addresses, contact details, account numbers, order details, passwords or payment data. The external AI provider processes submitted text under its own terms and retention policy.') %></p><div id=\"ai-answer\" class=\"ai-answer\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></section><% } %>\n<%- include('partials/footer') %>","imprint.ejs":"<%- include('partials/header', {title: title}) %>\n<section class=\"container page-head policy-head\">\n  <%- include('partials/back-button', {fallback: '/'}) %>\n  <span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'TRANSPARANTIE':locale==='ckb'?'ڕوونی':locale==='ar'?'الشفافية':'TRANSPARENCY') %></span>\n  <h1><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Bedrijfsgegevens':locale==='ckb'?'زانیاریی کۆمپانیا':locale==='ar'?'معلومات الشركة':'Business information') %></h1>\n  <p><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Dit zijn de gegevens die de winkelbeheerder heeft ingevuld.':locale==='ckb'?'ئەمە ئەو زانیارییانەن کە بەڕێوەبەری فرۆشگا تۆماری کردوون.':locale==='ar'?'هذه هي البيانات التي أدخلها مدير المتجر.':'These are the business details provided by the store operator.') %></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"container section policy-section\">\n  <article class=\"panel policy-copy business-imprint\" aria-label=\"<%= title %>\">\n    <dl class=\"legal-detail-list\">\n      <div><dt><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Winkelnaam':locale==='ckb'?'ناوی فرۆشگا':locale==='ar'?'اسم المتجر':'Store name') %></dt><dd><%= storeName %></dd></div>\n      <% if(legalName){ %><div><dt><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Juridische naam':locale==='ckb'?'ناوی یاسایی':locale==='ar'?'الاسم القانوني':'Legal business name') %></dt><dd><%= legalName %></dd></div><% } %>\n      <% if(businessAddress){ %><div><dt><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Vestigingsadres':locale==='ckb'?'ناونیشانی کار':locale==='ar'?'عنوان النشاط':'Business address') %></dt><dd><%= businessAddress %></dd></div><% } %>\n      <% if(enterpriseNumber){ %><div><dt><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Ondernemingsnummer / registratie':locale==='ckb'?'ژمارەی تۆمار':locale==='ar'?'رقم التسجيل':'Business registration') %></dt><dd><%= enterpriseNumber %></dd></div><% } %>\n      <% if(vatNumber){ %><div><dt><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Btw-nummer':locale==='ckb'?'ژمارەی باج':locale==='ar'?'الرقم الضريبي':'Tax / VAT number') %></dt><dd><%= vatNumber %></dd></div><% } %>\n      <% if(supportEmail){ %><div><dt><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'E-mail':locale==='ckb'?'ئیمەیڵ':locale==='ar'?'البريد الإلكتروني':'Email') %></dt><dd><a href=\"mailto:<%= supportEmail %>\"><%= supportEmail %></a></dd></div><% } %>\n      <% if(businessPhone){ %><div><dt><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Telefoon':locale==='ckb'?'تەلەفۆن':locale==='ar'?'الهاتف':'Telephone') %></dt><dd><a href=\"tel:<%= String(businessPhone).replace(/[^+0-9]/g,'') %>\"><%= businessPhone %></a></dd></div><% } %>\n    </dl>\n    <% if(!legalName||!businessAddress||!enterpriseNumber||!supportEmail||!businessPhone){ %>\n      <div class=\"alert\" role=\"note\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Niet alle bedrijfsgegevens zijn ingevuld. De winkelbeheerder moet de verplichte informatie voor het land van vestiging aanvullen voordat de winkel live gaat.':locale==='ckb'?'هەموو زانیارییەکانی کۆمپانیا پڕ نەکراونەتەوە. بەڕێوەبەر دەبێت پێش دەستپێکردنی فرۆشتن زانیاریی یاساییی پێویست تەواو بکات.':locale==='ar'?'لم تُستكمل جميع بيانات النشاط التجاري. يجب على مدير المتجر إضافة المعلومات القانونية المطلوبة قبل البيع.':'Some business identity fields are not configured. The operator must provide all legally required details for the actual merchant country before accepting live orders.') %></div>\n    <% } %>\n    <p><a href=\"/terms\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Algemene voorwaarden':locale==='ckb'?'مەرجەکان':locale==='ar'?'الشروط والأحكام':'Terms & conditions') %></a> · <a href=\"/privacy\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Privacybeleid':locale==='ckb'?'سیاسەتی تایبەتمەندی':locale==='ar'?'سياسة الخصوصية':'Privacy policy') %></a> · <a href=\"/shipping-returns\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Verzending en retouren':locale==='ckb'?'گەیاندن و گەڕاندنەوە':locale==='ar'?'الشحن والإرجاع':'Shipping and returns') %></a></p>\n  </article>\n</section>\n<%- include('partials/footer') %>\n","local-manager-recovery.ejs":"<%- include('partials/header',{title:title||'Local Manager recovery'}) %>\n<section class=\"auth-wrap\" id=\"main-content\">\n  <div class=\"auth-card local-manager-recovery-card\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY</span>\n    <h1>Manager account recovery</h1>\n    <p class=\"muted\">This page is available only from this computer when ShopEasy is running in development mode with a local SQLite database. It is not a public password-reset page.</p>\n    <% if(error){ %><div class=\"alert\" role=\"alert\"><%= error %></div><% } %>\n    <% if(success){ %><div class=\"success-alert\" role=\"status\"><%= success %></div><% } %>\n    <section class=\"form-stack\" aria-labelledby=\"manager-status-heading\">\n      <h2 id=\"manager-status-heading\">Manager status</h2>\n      <% if(managerFound){ %>\n        <p><strong>Manager account:</strong> <%= managerName||'Store Manager' %></p>\n        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <%= managerEmail %></p>\n        <p><strong>Login status:</strong> <%= loginStatus %></p>\n        <p class=\"field-note\">This page does not display or change your authenticator secret or recovery codes.</p>\n        <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n        <h2>Option 1 · Unlock only</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Use this if you know your current password and only want to clear the failed-login block. Your password and MFA remain unchanged.</p>\n        <form class=\"form-stack\" method=\"post\" action=\"/local-manager-recovery\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"unlock\">\n          <label>Confirm Manager email<input type=\"email\" name=\"managerEmail\" required maxlength=\"120\" autocomplete=\"off\" value=\"<%= managerEmail %>\"></label>\n          <label>Type UNLOCK MANAGER<input type=\"text\" name=\"confirmation\" required autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></label>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-dark btn-wide\" type=\"submit\">Clear login block</button>\n        </form>\n        <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n        <h2>Option 2 · Set a new password</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Use this only if your current password is unknown or incorrect. Existing MFA settings are preserved.</p>\n        <form class=\"form-stack\" method=\"post\" action=\"/local-manager-recovery\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"reset-password\">\n          <label>Confirm Manager email<input type=\"email\" name=\"managerEmail\" required maxlength=\"120\" autocomplete=\"off\" value=\"<%= managerEmail %>\"></label>\n          <label>New password<input type=\"password\" name=\"newPassword\" required minlength=\"8\" maxlength=\"200\" autocomplete=\"new-password\"></label>\n          <label>Confirm new password<input type=\"password\" name=\"confirmPassword\" required minlength=\"8\" maxlength=\"200\" autocomplete=\"new-password\"></label>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-dark btn-wide\" type=\"submit\">Update Manager password</button>\n        </form>\n      <% } else { %>\n        <div class=\"alert\" role=\"status\"><%= loginStatus %></div>\n        <p class=\"muted\">The page will not create a new Manager or promote an Admin. Check the Manager bootstrap settings and restart the local application first.</p>\n      <% } %>\n    </section>\n    <p class=\"switch-auth\"><a href=\"/login\">Return to sign in</a></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<%- include('partials/footer') %>\n","login.ejs":"<%- include('partials/header',{title:mode==='register'?'Create account':'Sign in'}) %>\n<section class=\"auth-wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"auth-title\"><div class=\"auth-card\"><nav class=\"auth-tabs\" aria-label=\"<%= pageText('Account access') %>\"><a href=\"<%= next ? `/login?next=${encodeURIComponent(next)}` : '/login' %>\" <% if(mode==='login'){ %>aria-current=\"page\"<% } %>><%= pageText(\"Sign in\") %></a><a href=\"<%= next ? `/register?next=${encodeURIComponent(next)}` : '/register' %>\" <% if(mode==='register'){ %>aria-current=\"page\"<% } %>><%= pageText(\"Create account\") %></a></nav><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= pageText(mode==='register'?'NEW CUSTOMER':'WELCOME BACK') %></span><h1 id=\"auth-title\"><%= pageText(mode==='register'?'Create your account':'Welcome back') %></h1><p class=\"muted\"><%= pageText(mode==='register'?'Join ShopEasy to track orders and check out faster.':'Sign in to your ShopEasy account.') %></p><% if(typeof passwordReset !== 'undefined' && passwordReset){ %><div class=\"success-alert\" role=\"status\"><%= pageText(\"Your password has been reset. Sign in with your new password.\") %></div><% } %><% if(typeof emailVerified !== 'undefined' && emailVerified){ %><div class=\"success-alert\" role=\"status\"><%= pageText(\"Your email address has been verified. You can sign in now.\") %></div><% } %><% if(typeof signInCancelled !== 'undefined' && signInCancelled){ %><div class=\"success-alert\" role=\"status\"><%= pageText(\"Sign-in was cancelled. Enter your credentials whenever you are ready to try again.\") %></div><% } %><% if(error){ %><div class=\"alert\" id=\"auth-error\" role=\"alert\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-auth-error><%= pageText(error) %></div><% } %><% if(typeof notice !== 'undefined' && notice){ %><div class=\"auth-next-step\" role=\"status\"><%= pageText(notice) %></div><% } %><% if(mode==='register'){ %><form class=\"form-stack\" method=\"post\" action=\"/register\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"next\" value=\"<%= next||'/account' %>\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\"><label><%= pageText(\"Full name\") %><input type=\"text\" name=\"fullName\" required maxlength=\"120\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"<%= pageText('Enter your full name') %>\" value=\"<%= fullName||'' %>\"></label><label><%= pageText(\"Email address\") %><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required maxlength=\"120\" autocomplete=\"email\" autocapitalize=\"none\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"<%= pageText('Enter your email address') %>\" value=\"<%= email||'' %>\"></label><label><%= pageText(\"Password\") %><input type=\"password\" name=\"password\" required minlength=\"8\" maxlength=\"200\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"<%= pageText('Create a password') %>\"><span class=\"field-note\"><%= pageText(\"Use at least 8 characters.\") %></span></label><label><%= pageText(\"Confirm password\") %><input type=\"password\" name=\"confirmPassword\" required minlength=\"8\" maxlength=\"200\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"<%= pageText('Re-enter your password') %>\"></label><label class=\"checkbox-inline auth-terms\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"termsAccepted\" required><span><%= pageText(\"I agree to the \") %><a href=\"/terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><%= pageText(\"Terms & Conditions\") %></a><%= pageText(\" and \") %><a href=\"/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><%= pageText(\"Privacy Policy\") %></a><%= pageText(\".\") %></span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-wide\"><%= pageText(\"Create account\") %></button></form><p class=\"switch-auth\"><%= pageText(\"Already have an account? \") %><a href=\"<%= next ? `/login?next=${encodeURIComponent(next)}` : '/login' %>\"><%= pageText(\"Sign in\") %></a></p><% } else { %><form class=\"form-stack\" method=\"post\" action=\"/login\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"next\" value=\"<%= next %>\"><label><%= pageText(\"Email address\") %><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required maxlength=\"120\" autocomplete=\"username\" autocapitalize=\"none\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"<%= pageText('Enter your email address') %>\" value=\"<%= email||'' %>\"></label><label><%= pageText(\"Password\") %><input type=\"password\" name=\"password\" required maxlength=\"200\" id=\"login-password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" placeholder=\"<%= pageText('Enter your password') %>\"></label><div class=\"auth-help\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"auth-password-toggle\" data-password-toggle data-labels=\"<%= JSON.stringify({show:pageText('Show password'),hide:pageText('Hide password')}) %>\" aria-controls=\"login-password\" aria-pressed=\"false\" hidden><%= pageText(\"Show password\") %></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"<%= next ? `/forgot-password?next=${encodeURIComponent(next)}` : '/forgot-password' %>\"><%= pageText(\"Forgot password?\") %></a></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-wide\"><%= pageText(\"Sign in\") %></button></form><p class=\"switch-auth\"><%= pageText(\"Don\\u2019t have an account yet? \") %><a href=\"<%= next ? `/register?next=${encodeURIComponent(next)}` : '/register' %>\"><%= pageText(\"Create an account\") %></a></p><div class=\"rule\"></div><details><summary><%= pageText(\"Need an email verification message?\") %></summary><form class=\"form-stack\" method=\"post\" action=\"/verify-email/resend\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\"><label><%= pageText(\"Email address\") %><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required maxlength=\"120\" autocomplete=\"username\" autocapitalize=\"none\" spellcheck=\"false\" value=\"<%= email||'' %>\"></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-dark\"><%= pageText(\"Resend verification\") %></button></form></details><% } %><p class=\"auth-browse\"><a href=\"/shop\"><%= pageText(\"Continue shopping\") %> <span aria-hidden=\"true\"><%= pageText(\"\\u2192\") %></span></a></p></div></section>\n<%- include('partials/footer') %>\n","mfa-disable.ejs":"<%- include('partials/header',{title:title||'Disable authenticator'}) %>\n<section class=\"auth-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"auth-card\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"MANAGER SECURITY\") %></span>\n    <h1><%= customerText(\"Reset two-factor authentication\") %></h1>\n    <p class=\"muted\"><%= customerText(\"Manager accounts cannot remain without MFA. This action turns off the current enrollment, revokes all sessions and requires a fresh authenticator setup the next time you sign in.\") %></p>\n    <% if(email){ %><p><strong><%= customerText(\"Account:\") %></strong> <%= email %></p><% } %>\n    <% if(error){ %><div class=\"alert\" role=\"alert\"><%= customerText(error) %></div><% } %>\n    <form class=\"form-stack\" method=\"post\" action=\"/mfa/disable\">\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\">\n      <label for=\"password\"><%= customerText(\"Current password\") %></label>\n      <input id=\"password\" name=\"password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" maxlength=\"200\" required>\n      <label for=\"code\"><%= customerText(\"Current authenticator code or unused recovery code\") %></label>\n      <input id=\"code\" name=\"code\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" maxlength=\"64\" required>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-wide\"><%= customerText(\"Reset MFA and revoke sessions\") %></button>\n    </form>\n    <p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/admin\"><%= customerText(\"Cancel and return to the dashboard\") %></a></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<%- include('partials/footer') %>\n","mfa-recovery-codes.ejs":"<%- include('partials/header',{title:title||'Save your recovery codes'}) %>\n<section class=\"auth-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"auth-card mfa-auth-card\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"MFA ACTIVATED\") %></span>\n    <h1><%= customerText(\"Save your recovery codes\") %></h1>\n    <div class=\"success-alert\" role=\"status\"><%= customerText(\"Two-factor authentication is active. Existing Manager sessions have been revoked.\") %></div>\n    <p><%= customerText(\"Each recovery code can be used once if you cannot access your authenticator app. These codes are shown only now. Store them somewhere private and separate from your password.\") %></p>\n    <ul class=\"mfa-recovery-codes\">\n      <% for (const code of codes) { %><li><code><%= code %></code></li><% } %>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"field-note\"><%= customerText(\"Do not share these codes. ShopEasy stores only SHA-256 hashes, not the displayed codes.\") %></p>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-dark btn-wide\" href=\"<%= nextPath %>\"><%= customerText(\"Continue to Manager dashboard\") %></a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<%- include('partials/footer') %>\n","mfa-setup.ejs":"<%- include('partials/header',{title:title||'Set up two-factor authentication'}) %>\n<section class=\"auth-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"auth-card mfa-auth-card\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"MANAGER SECURITY\") %></span>\n    <h1><%= customerText(\"Set up your authenticator\") %></h1>\n    <p class=\"muted\"><%= customerText(\"This is the first sign-in for this Manager account. Two-factor authentication is required before store management can open. Scan this QR code with Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator, 1Password or another TOTP app, or enter the setup key manually below.\") %></p>\n    <% if(error){ %><div class=\"alert\" role=\"alert\"><%= customerText(error) %></div><% } %>\n    <p><strong><%= customerText(\"Account:\") %></strong> <%= email %></p>\n    <% if(qrDataUrl){ %>\n      <div class=\"mfa-qr-frame\">\n        <img id=\"mfa-qr-image\" src=\"<%= qrDataUrl %>\" alt=\"QR code for the ShopEasy authenticator setup\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\" class=\"mfa-qr-image\" decoding=\"sync\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mfa-qr-actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"mfa-download-qr\" class=\"btn btn-outline\"><%= customerText(\"Download QR code (PNG)\") %></button>\n      </div>\n      <p id=\"mfa-download-status\" class=\"mfa-download-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p>\n      <section class=\"mfa-manual-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"mfa-manual-title\">\n        <h2 id=\"mfa-manual-title\"><%= customerText(\"Or enter manually:\") %></h2>\n        <p><%= customerText(\"In your authenticator app, choose the option to enter a setup key manually, then enter this key. Keep it private and do not send it to anyone.\") %></p>\n        <p class=\"mfa-secret-wrap\"><code id=\"manual-secret\" class=\"mfa-manual-secret\"><%= secret %></code></p>\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"mfa-copy-key\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-copy-target=\"manual-secret\"><%= customerText(\"Copy key\") %></button>\n        <p id=\"mfa-copy-status\" class=\"field-note\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n      </section>\n      <p class=\"field-note\"><%= customerText(\"Scan the QR code OR enter the key manually. Both methods connect your authenticator to the same setup.\") %></p>\n      <hr>\n      <form class=\"form-stack\" method=\"post\" action=\"/mfa/verify\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\">\n        <label for=\"code\"><%= customerText(\"6-digit authenticator code\") %></label>\n        <input id=\"code\" name=\"code\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]{6}\" minlength=\"6\" maxlength=\"6\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" required autofocus>\n        <p class=\"field-note\"><%= customerText(\"Enter the current code shown by your authenticator app to activate MFA.\") %></p>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-wide\"><%= customerText(\"Verify and activate MFA\") %></button>\n      </form>\n      <details class=\"mfa-regenerate-details\">\n        <summary><%= customerText(\"Need to generate a new setup key?\") %></summary>\n        <p><%= customerText(\"Only do this if you want to replace the current, not-yet-activated setup key.\") %></p>\n        <form method=\"post\" action=\"/mfa/setup\" class=\"form-stack\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\">\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-outline\"><%= customerText(\"Generate a new setup QR\") %></button>\n        </form>\n      </details>\n    <% } else { %>\n      <p class=\"alert\" role=\"alert\"><%= customerText(\"The QR code could not be prepared. Check the server configuration and sign in again.\") %></p>\n    <% } %>\n    <form method=\"post\" action=\"/mfa/cancel\" class=\"form-stack mfa-cancel-form\">\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\">\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-wide\"><%= customerText(\"Cancel sign-in and return to login\") %></button>\n    </form>\n    <p class=\"field-note\"><%= customerText(\"The browser Back button does not cancel a security challenge. Use this button to safely end this sign-in attempt.\") %></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<% if(qrDataUrl){ %><script src=\"/js/mfa-setup.js?v=2.8.93-r12.11-e2-repair13-hardcheck7-2026-11-04\" defer></script><% } %>\n<%- include('partials/footer') %>\n","mfa-verify.ejs":"<%- include('partials/header',{title:title||'Two-factor verification'}) %>\n<section class=\"auth-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"auth-card\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"MANAGER SECURITY\") %></span>\n    <h1><%= customerText(\"Verify it is you\") %></h1>\n    <p class=\"muted\"><%= customerText(\"Enter the current 6-digit code from your authenticator app. A saved one-time recovery code also works if your authenticator is unavailable.\") %></p>\n    <% if(email){ %><p><strong><%= customerText(\"Account:\") %></strong> <%= email %></p><% } %>\n    <% if(error){ %><div class=\"alert\" role=\"alert\"><%= customerText(error) %></div><% } %>\n    <form class=\"form-stack\" method=\"post\" action=\"/mfa/verify\">\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\">\n      <label for=\"code\"><%= customerText(\"Authenticator or recovery code\") %></label>\n      <input id=\"code\" name=\"code\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"text\" maxlength=\"64\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" autocapitalize=\"characters\" spellcheck=\"false\" required autofocus>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-wide\"><%= customerText(\"Verify and sign in\") %></button>\n    </form>\n    <p class=\"field-note\"><%= customerText(\"A challenge expires after 5 minutes. Codes are limited to 5 attempts per 15-minute window.\") %></p>\n    <form method=\"post\" action=\"/mfa/cancel\" class=\"form-stack\">\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\">\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-outline\"><%= customerText(\"Cancel sign-in\") %></button>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<%- include('partials/footer') %>\n","order-lookup.ejs":"<%- include('partials/header',{title:'Track an order'}) %>\n<section class=\"container page-head order-lookup-head\"><%- include('partials/back-button', { fallback: '/' }) %><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"ORDER SUPPORT\") %></span><h1><%= customerText(\"Track an order\") %></h1><p><%= customerText(\"Enter your order number and the same email address used at checkout to see the latest status, delivery progress and any return options.\") %></p></div></section>\n<section class=\"container section\"><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-heading-v5\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"ORDER LOOKUP\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(\"Check the latest update\") %></h2><p class=\"muted\"><%= customerText(\"We only show orders when both details match so customer information stays protected.\") %></p></div></div>\n<% if(typeof securityNotice!=='undefined' && securityNotice){ %><div class=\"alert\" role=\"status\"><%= customerText(\"Your security check expired. The lookup was not submitted. Enter your details again on this secure form.\") %></div><% } %>\n<form method=\"post\" action=\"/order-lookup\" class=\"form-stack\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\"><label><%= customerText(\"Order number\") %><input name=\"orderNumber\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]{1,12}\" required maxlength=\"12\"></label><label><%= customerText(\"Email address\") %><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required maxlength=\"120\"></label><button class=\"btn btn-dark\" type=\"submit\"><%= customerText(\"Find order\") %></button></form>\n<% if(error){ %><div class=\"alert\" role=\"alert\"><%= customerText(error) %></div><% } %><% if(typeof returnRequested!=='undefined' && returnRequested){ %><div class=\"success-alert\" role=\"status\"><%= customerText(\"Your return request was sent to the store for review.\") %></div><% } %>\n<% if(order){ const statusNames={pending:'Received',paid:'Payment recorded',processing:'Preparing',shipped:'Shipped',completed:'Delivered',cancelled:'Cancelled'}; const deliveryText=order.status==='completed'?'Delivered':order.status==='cancelled'?'Not available':'A delivery date has not yet been confirmed by the store or carrier.'; %>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div><h2><%= customerText(\"Order #\") %><%= order.id %></h2><p><strong><%= customerText(\"Status:\") %></strong> <%= statusNames[order.status]||order.status %></p><p><strong><%= customerText(\"Delivery:\") %></strong> <%= deliveryText %></p><h3><%= customerText(\"Items\") %></h3><ul><% order.items.forEach(item=>{ %><li><%= item.product_name %><% if(item.variant_value){ %> — <%= item.variant_name %>: <%= item.variant_value %><% } %> × <%= item.quantity %></li><% }) %></ul><p><strong><%= customerText(\"Total:\") %></strong> <%= formatPrice(order.total_cents,order.currency) %></p>\n<% if(order.payment_provider==='bank_transfer'&&(typeof bankTransferInfo!=='undefined' && bankTransferInfo)&&order.status==='pending'){ %><div class=\"tip-box\"><strong><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Bankgegevens voor je overschrijving':locale==='ckb'?'زانیاریی بانکی بۆ گواستنەوەکەت':locale==='ar'?'بيانات التحويل المصرفي':'Bank transfer details') %></strong><p><%= bankTransferInfo.bankName %> · <%= bankTransferInfo.accountHolder %></p><p><strong><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'IBAN / rekeningnummer':locale==='ckb'?'IBAN / ژمارەی هەژمار':locale==='ar'?'IBAN / رقم الحساب':'IBAN / account') %>:</strong> <code><%= bankTransferInfo.account %></code></p><% if(bankTransferInfo.bic){ %><p><strong>BIC/SWIFT:</strong> <code><%= bankTransferInfo.bic %></code></p><% } %><p><strong><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Betalingsreferentie':locale==='ckb'?'ژمارەی تایبەتی پارەدان':locale==='ar'?'مرجع الدفع':'Payment reference') %>:</strong> <code><%= bankTransferInfo.reference %></code></p><p><strong><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Bedrag':locale==='ckb'?'بڕی پارە':locale==='ar'?'المبلغ':'Amount') %>:</strong> <%= formatPrice(order.total_cents,order.currency) %></p><% if(bankTransferInfo.instructions){ %><p><%= bankTransferInfo.instructions %></p><% } %><p class=\"field-note\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Je bestelling blijft onbetaald totdat de winkel de overschrijving heeft gecontroleerd.':locale==='ckb'?'داواکارییەکەت تا پشتڕاستکردنەوەی گواستنەوەکە لەلایەن فرۆشگا پارەدراو نابێت.':locale==='ar'?'يبقى طلبك غير مدفوع حتى يتحقق المتجر من وصول التحويل.':'Your order stays unpaid until the store verifies the incoming transfer.') %></p></div><% } %>\n<% if(order.returnable){ %><div class=\"rule\"></div><h3><%= customerText(\"Request a return\") %></h3><form method=\"post\" action=\"/order/<%= order.id %>/return-request\" class=\"form-stack\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"email\" value=\"<%= lookupEmail||'' %>\"><label><%= customerText(\"Item\") %><select name=\"orderItemId\" required><% order.items.forEach(item=>{ %><option value=\"<%= item.id %>\"><%= item.product_name %> — <%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'gekocht':'purchased') %> <%= item.quantity %></option><% }) %></select></label><label><%= customerText(\"Quantity\") %><input type=\"number\" name=\"quantity\" min=\"1\" max=\"99\" value=\"1\" required></label><label><%= customerText(\"Request type\") %><select name=\"requestType\" required><option value=\"return\"><%= customerText(\"Return\") %></option><option value=\"exchange\"><%= customerText(\"Exchange\") %></option><option value=\"refund\"><%= customerText(\"Refund review\") %></option></select></label><label><%= customerText(\"Reason\") %><select name=\"reasonCode\" required><option value=\"damaged\"><%= customerText(\"Damaged item\") %></option><option value=\"wrong_item\"><%= customerText(\"Wrong item received\") %></option><option value=\"not_as_described\"><%= customerText(\"Not as described\") %></option><option value=\"changed_mind\"><%= customerText(\"Changed my mind\") %></option><option value=\"other\"><%= customerText(\"Other\") %></option></select></label><label><%= customerText(\"Additional details (optional)\") %><textarea name=\"note\" maxlength=\"800\" rows=\"3\"></textarea></label><button class=\"btn btn-dark\" type=\"submit\"><%= customerText(\"Send return request\") %></button></form><% } %>\n<% } %></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>\n","order.ejs":"<%- include('partials/header',{title:`Order #${order.id}`}) %>\n<%\nconst statusLabels={\n  fr:{pending:'En attente de confirmation',processing:'Acceptée · en préparation',shipped:'Expédiée · en livraison',completed:'Livrée',cancelled:'Annulée',paid:'Payée'},\n  en:{pending:'Waiting for confirmation',processing:'Accepted · preparing',shipped:'Shipped · out for delivery',completed:'Delivered',cancelled:'Cancelled',paid:'Paid'},\n  ckb:{pending:'چاوەڕوانی پشتڕاستکردنەوە',processing:'پەسەندکرا · ئامادە دەکرێت',shipped:'نێردراوە · لە ڕێگای گەیاندندایە',completed:'گەیێندراوە',cancelled:'هەڵوەشێنراوەتەوە',paid:'پارە دراوە'},\n  ar:{pending:'بانتظار التأكيد',processing:'تم القبول · قيد التجهيز',shipped:'تم الشحن · في طريق التوصيل',completed:'تم التسليم',cancelled:'ملغى',paid:'مدفوع'},\n  nl:{pending:'Wacht op bevestiging',processing:'Geaccepteerd · wordt klaargemaakt',shipped:'Verzonden · onderweg',completed:'Geleverd',cancelled:'Geannuleerd',paid:'Betaald'}\n};\nconst stateText=statusLabels[locale]||statusLabels.en;\nconst statusFlow=order.status==='paid'?['paid','processing','shipped','completed']:['pending','processing','shipped','completed'];\nconst statusIndex=Math.max(0,statusFlow.indexOf(order.status));\nconst cancelMessages={\n  cancelled:locale==='ckb'?'داواکارییەکە هەڵوەشێنرایەوە.':locale==='ar'?'تم إلغاء الطلب.':locale==='nl'?'Je bestelling is geannuleerd. Je kunt verder winkelen.':'Your order was cancelled. You can return to shopping.',\n  requested:locale==='ckb'?'داواکاریی هەڵوەشاندنەوە نێردرا؛ فرۆشگا پێداچوونەوەی بۆ دەکات.':locale==='ar'?'تم إرسال طلب الإلغاء إلى المتجر للمراجعة.':locale==='nl'?'Je annuleringsverzoek is naar de winkel gestuurd ter beoordeling.':'Your cancellation request was sent to the store for review.',\n  'already-requested':locale==='ckb'?'داواکارییەکەت پێشتر نێردراوە.':locale==='ar'?'تم إرسال طلب الإلغاء من قبل.':locale==='nl'?'Je hebt al een annulering aangevraagd.':'You have already requested cancellation.',\n  unavailable:locale==='ckb'?'ئەم داواکارییە لەم قۆناغەدا ناتوانرێت هەڵبوەشێنرێتەوە.':locale==='ar'?'لا يمكن إلغاء هذا الطلب في مرحلته الحالية.':locale==='nl'?'Deze bestelling kan in de huidige status niet worden geannuleerd.':'This order cannot be cancelled in its current state.',\n  'reason-required':locale==='ckb'?'تکایە هۆکار بنووسە.':locale==='ar'?'يرجى إدخال سبب طلب الإلغاء.':locale==='nl'?'Vermeld een reden voordat je annulering aanvraagt.':'Enter a reason before requesting cancellation.',\n  changed:locale==='ckb'?'دۆخی داواکاری گۆڕاوە. پەڕەکە نوێ بکەرەوە.':locale==='ar'?'تغيرت حالة الطلب. حدّث الصفحة.':locale==='nl'?'De status van je bestelling is gewijzigd. Vernieuw de pagina en controleer de actuele status.':'The order status changed. Refresh and check the current status.'\n};\n%>\n<% if(typeof securityNotice!=='undefined' && securityNotice){ %><section class=\"container\"><div class=\"alert\" role=\"status\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Je beveiligingscontrole is verlopen. Er is geen wijziging aan de bestelling verzonden. Controleer de huidige bestelstatus voordat je een nieuw verzoek indient.':'Your security check expired. No order update was submitted. Review the current order status before sending another request.') %></div></section><% } %>\n<section class=\"container page-head order-page-head\">\n  <%- include('partials/back-button', { fallback: '/account' }) %>\n  <div class=\"order-head-line\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"ORDER\") %></span><h1>#<%= order.id %></h1></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light\" data-print-order><%= customerText(\"Print / save PDF\") %></button></div>\n  <div class=\"order-current-state\"><span class=\"status status-<%= order.status %>\"><%= stateText[order.status]||order.status %></span><time datetime=\"<%= order.created_at %>\" title=\"<%= formatDateTimeDisplay(order.created_at,storeTimeZone) %>\"><%= formatRelativeTime(order.created_at) %></time></div>\n</section>\n\n<% if(cancelResult && cancelMessages[cancelResult]){ %><section class=\"container\"><div class=\"<%= cancelResult==='cancelled'?'success-alert':'alert' %> order-notice\" role=\"status\"><%= customerText(cancelMessages[cancelResult]) %></div></section><% } %>\n\n<section class=\"container order-status-panel\">\n  <% if(order.status==='cancelled'){ %><div class=\"cancelled-state\"><span class=\"state-icon\">!</span><div><strong><%= customerText(\"Order cancelled\") %></strong><p><%= customerText(\"The order will not be delivered.\") %></p></div></div><% } else { %>\n    <div class=\"status-panel-title\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"ORDER PROGRESS\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(\"Track your order\") %></h2></div><strong><%= stateText[order.status]||order.status %></strong></div>\n    <div class=\"order-timeline\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"<%= customerText(\"Order progress\") %>\">\n      <% statusFlow.forEach((state,idx)=>{ const done=idx<=statusIndex; %><div class=\"timeline-step <%= done?'done':'' %> <%= idx===statusIndex?'current':'' %>\"><span class=\"timeline-dot\"><%= idx<statusIndex?'✓':idx+1 %></span><div><strong><%= customerText(stateText[state]) %></strong><small><%= customerText(state==='paid'?'Payment received; awaiting store confirmation.':state==='pending'?'Order received':state==='processing'?'Store is preparing it':state==='shipped'?'Delivery is on the way':'Order completed') %></small></div></div><% if(idx<statusFlow.length-1){ %><span class=\"timeline-line <%= idx<statusIndex?'done':'' %>\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><% } %><% }) %>\n    </div>\n  <% } %>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"container order-layout order-layout-v5\">\n  <div class=\"order-main-stack\">\n    <div class=\"panel order-items-card\"><div class=\"panel-heading-v5\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"ORDER CONTENTS\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(\"Items\") %></h2></div><span><%= order.items.length %><%= customerText(\" item\") %><%= customerText(order.items.length===1?'':'s') %></span></div>\n      <div class=\"order-items-v5\"><% order.items.forEach(i=>{ %><div class=\"order-product-row\"><div class=\"order-product-thumb\"><img src=\"<%= safeImageUrl(i.image_url||'/assets/product-placeholder.svg') %>\" data-fallback-src=\"/assets/product-placeholder.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"order-product-info\"><strong data-no-translate><%= i.product_name %></strong><% if(i.variant_value){ %><span><%= i.variant_name %>: <%= i.variant_value %><% if(i.variant_value_2){ %> · <%= i.variant_name_2 %>: <%= i.variant_value_2 %><% } %></span><% } %><small><%= customerText(\"Quantity × \") %><%= i.quantity %></small></div><strong class=\"order-product-price\"><%= formatPrice(i.total_cents,order.currency) %></strong></div><% }) %></div>\n      <div class=\"order-total-box\"><div><span><%= customerText(\"Items subtotal\") %></span><strong><%= formatPrice(order.subtotal_cents,order.currency) %></strong></div><% if(order.automatic_discount_cents>0){ %><div><span><%= customerText(\"Automatic product discounts\") %></span><strong>-<%= formatPrice(order.automatic_discount_cents,order.currency) %></strong></div><% } %><% if(order.discount_cents>0){ %><div><span><%= customerText(\"Coupon discount\") %></span><strong>-<%= formatPrice(order.discount_cents,order.currency) %></strong></div><% } %><div><span><%= customerText(\"Delivery fee\") %></span><strong><%= order.shipping_cents===0?'Free':formatPrice(order.shipping_cents,order.currency) %></strong></div><% if(order.tax_rate_bps!==null&&order.tax_rate_bps!==undefined){ %><div><span><%= customerText(order.tax_included?(locale==='nl'?'Belasting inbegrepen in de prijzen':locale==='ckb'?'باژ لە نرخەکاندا هەژمار کراوە':locale==='ar'?'الضريبة مشمولة في الأسعار':'Tax included in prices'):(locale==='nl'?'Belasting toegevoegd':locale==='ckb'?'باژ زیاد کراوە':locale==='ar'?'تمت إضافة الضريبة':'Tax added')) %> (<%= (Number(order.tax_rate_bps)/100).toFixed(2) %>%)</span><strong><%= formatPrice(order.tax_cents||0,order.currency) %></strong></div><% } else { %><p class=\"field-note\"><%= customerText(\"No regional tax rule was recorded for this order; this is not a tax-compliance confirmation.\") %></p><% } %><div class=\"grand-total\"><span><%= customerText(\"Total\") %></span><strong><%= formatPrice(order.total_cents,order.currency) %></strong></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"order-side-stack\">\n    <div class=\"panel order-info-card\"><div class=\"panel-heading-v5\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"DELIVERY\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(\"Delivery details\") %></h2></div></div><div class=\"delivery-person\"><span class=\"person-avatar\"><%= (order.shipping_name||'?').slice(0,1).toUpperCase() %></span><div><strong><%= order.shipping_name %></strong><span><%= customerText(\"Delivery address\") %></span></div></div><p class=\"address-block\"><%= order.shipping_address %><br><%= order.shipping_postal_code %> <%= order.shipping_city %><br><%= order.shipping_country %></p><div class=\"payment-chip\"><span><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Betaalmethode':locale==='ckb'?'شێوازی پارەدان':locale==='ar'?'طريقة الدفع':'Payment method') %></span><strong><%= customerText(order.payment_provider==='cash_on_delivery'?(locale==='nl'?'Contant bij levering':'Cash on delivery'):order.payment_provider==='bank_transfer'?(locale==='nl'?'Bankoverschrijving':locale==='ckb'?'گواستنەوەی بانکی':locale==='ar'?'تحويل مصرفي':'Bank transfer'):order.payment_provider==='mollie'?'Card payment':order.payment_provider==='gift_card'?'Gift card':'Payment method') %></strong></div><% if(order.payment_provider==='bank_transfer'&&(typeof bankTransferInfo!=='undefined' && bankTransferInfo)&&order.status==='pending'){ %><div class=\"tip-box\"><strong><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Betaal per bankoverschrijving':locale==='ckb'?'پارەدان بە گواستنەوەی بانکی':locale==='ar'?'الدفع بالتحويل المصرفي':'Pay by bank transfer') %></strong><p><%= bankTransferInfo.bankName %> · <%= bankTransferInfo.accountHolder %></p><p><strong><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Rekening':'Account') %>:</strong> <code><%= bankTransferInfo.account %></code></p><% if(bankTransferInfo.bic){ %><p><strong>BIC/SWIFT:</strong> <code><%= bankTransferInfo.bic %></code></p><% } %><p><strong><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Referentie':'Reference') %>:</strong> <code><%= bankTransferInfo.reference %></code></p><p><strong><%= formatPrice(order.total_cents,order.currency) %></strong></p><% if(bankTransferInfo.instructions){ %><p><%= bankTransferInfo.instructions %></p><% } %><p class=\"field-note\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Je bestelling blijft onbetaald totdat de winkel de ontvangst controleert.':'Your order remains unpaid until the store verifies the incoming transfer.') %></p></div><% } %><% if(order.customer_note){ %><div class=\"customer-note\"><span><%= customerText(\"Order note\") %></span><p><%= order.customer_note %></p></div><% } %></div>\n\n    <div class=\"panel order-action-card\">\n      <% if(order.status==='pending'&&order.payment_provider==='bank_transfer'){ %><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"CHANGES\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(\"Request cancellation\") %></h2><% if(order.cancellation_request_decision==='pending'){ %><div class=\"alert\" role=\"status\"><%= customerText(\"Your cancellation request is waiting for the store's decision. Do not send another bank transfer while the request is being reviewed.\") %></div><p><strong><%= customerText(\"Reason:\") %></strong> <%= order.cancellation_request_reason %></p><% } else { %><p><%= customerText(\"Bank transfers can arrive after they are sent. To avoid releasing reserved stock while a payment may still be in transit, the store must review your cancellation request.\") %></p><form method=\"post\" action=\"/account/order/<%= order.id %>/cancel\" class=\"form-stack\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\"><label><%= customerText(\"Reason *\") %><textarea name=\"reason\" required maxlength=\"500\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"<%= customerText(\"Explain why you need to cancel this bank-transfer order.\") %>\"></textarea></label><button class=\"btn btn-light\" type=\"submit\"><%= customerText(\"Request cancellation\") %></button></form><% } %>\n      <% } else if(order.status==='pending'){ %><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"CHANGES\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(\"Need to cancel?\") %></h2><p><%= customerText(\"You may cancel while the store is still reviewing the order.\") %></p><form method=\"post\" action=\"/account/order/<%= order.id %>/cancel\" class=\"form-stack\" data-confirm=\"<%= customerText(\"Cancel this order?\") %>\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\"><label><%= customerText(\"Reason (optional)\") %><textarea name=\"reason\" maxlength=\"500\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"<%= customerText(\"I no longer need this item.\") %>\"></textarea></label><button class=\"btn btn-light\" type=\"submit\"><%= customerText(\"Cancel order\") %></button></form>\n      <% } else if(order.status==='processing'&&order.payment_provider==='cash_on_delivery'){ %><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"CHANGES\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Annulering aanvragen':locale==='ckb'?'داوای هەڵوەشاندنەوە':'Request cancellation') %></h2><% if(order.cancellation_request_decision==='pending'){ %><div class=\"alert\" role=\"status\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Je annuleringsverzoek wacht op beoordeling door de winkel.':locale==='ckb'?'داواکاریی هەڵوەشاندنەوەکەت چاوەڕوانی پێداچوونەوەی فرۆشگایە.':\"Your cancellation request is waiting for the store's decision.\") %></div><p><strong><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Reden':locale==='ckb'?'هۆکار':'Reason') %>:</strong> <%= order.cancellation_request_reason %></p><% } else { %><p><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'De winkel heeft je bestelling aanvaard. Je kunt vóór verzending een annulering aanvragen.':locale==='ckb'?'فرۆشگا داواکارییەکەت پەسەند کردووە. پێش ناردنی کاڵا دەتوانیت داوای هەڵوەشاندنەوە بکەیت.':'The store accepted your order. You can request cancellation before it ships.') %></p><form method=\"post\" action=\"/account/order/<%= order.id %>/cancel\" class=\"form-stack\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"<%= csrf %>\"><label><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Reden *':locale==='ckb'?'هۆکار *':'Reason *') %><textarea name=\"reason\" required maxlength=\"500\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"<%= locale==='nl'?'Leg uit waarom je wilt annuleren.':locale==='ckb'?'هۆکاری داوای هەڵوەشاندنەوە بنووسە.':'Explain why you need to cancel.' %>\"></textarea></label><button class=\"btn btn-light\" type=\"submit\"><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Annulering aanvragen':locale==='ckb'?'داوای هەڵوەشاندنەوە':'Request cancellation') %></button></form><% } %>\n      <% } else if(order.status==='paid'||order.status==='processing'){ %><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText('PAYMENT') %></span><h2><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Betaald · wijziging nodig?':locale==='ckb'?'پارە دراوە · پێویستت بە گۆڕانکارییە؟':locale==='ar'?'مدفوع · هل تحتاج إلى تغيير؟':'Payment received') %></h2><p><%= customerText(locale==='nl'?'Deze bestelling is al betaald. ShopEasy voert geen automatische terugbetaling uit via een annuleringsverzoek. Neem vóór verzending contact op met de winkel; na levering kun je via deze pagina een retour- of terugbetalingsverzoek indienen.':locale==='ckb'?'پارەی ئەم داواکارییە وەرگیراوە. ShopEasy بە داواکاریی هەڵوەشاندنەوە پارە بە ئۆتۆماتیکی ناگەڕێنێتەوە. پێش ناردنی کاڵا پەیوەندی بە فرۆشگا بکە؛ دوای گەیاندن دەتوانیت داواکاریی گەڕاندنەوە بنێریت.':locale==='ar'?'تم استلام الدفع. لا ينفذ ShopEasy استردادًا تلقائيًا عبر طلب الإلغاء. اتصل بالمتجر قبل الشحن؛ وبعد التسليم يمكنك تقديم طلب إرجاع أو استرداد من هذه الصفحة.':'Payment has been received. ShopEasy does not automatically refund paid orders through a cancellation request. Contact the store before shipment; after delivery, you can submit a return or refund request from this page.') %></p>\n      <% } else if(order.status==='shipped'){ %><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"DELIVERY\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(\"Delivery in progress\") %></h2><p><%= customerText(\"Your order is already out for delivery. Contact the store using the contact details on its policy page.\") %></p><a class=\"btn btn-light\" href=\"/shipping-returns\"><%= customerText(\"Shipping & returns\") %></a>\n      <% } else if(order.status==='completed'){ %><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"AFTER DELIVERY\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(\"Need a return?\") %></h2><p><%= customerText(\"This order is marked delivered. Use the returns policy to ask for a return or refund.\") %></p><a class=\"btn btn-light\" href=\"/shipping-returns\"><%= customerText(\"Shipping & returns\") %></a>\n      <% } else { %><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"ORDER\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(\"Order closed\") %></h2><p><%= customerText(\"This order is no longer editable.\") %></p><% } %>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</section>\n<% if((orderHistory||[]).length){ %><section class=\"container section\"><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-heading-v5\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><%= customerText(\"ORDER HISTORY\") %></span><h2><%= customerText(locale==='ckb'?'مێژووی داواکاری':locale==='ar'?'سجل الطلب':'Order status history') %></h2><p class=\"muted\"><%= customerText(locale==='ckb'?'هەر گۆڕانکارییەک لە دۆخی داواکاری لێرە پیشان دەدرێت.':locale==='ar'?'يظهر هنا كل تغيير في حالة الطلب.':'Every recorded status change appears here, including cancellation.') %></p></div></div><ol class=\"form-stack order-history-list\"><% orderHistory.forEach(event=>{ %><li><div><strong><%= stateText[event.to_status]||event.to_status %></strong><small class=\"muted\"><time datetime=\"<%= event.created_at %>\" title=\"<%= formatDateTimeDisplay(event.created_at,storeTimeZone) %>\"><%= formatDateTimeDisplay(event.created_at,storeTimeZone) %></time></small><% if(event.note){ %><p class=\"muted\"><%= event.note %></p><% } %></div></li><% }) %></ol></div></section><% } %>\n\n<%\nconst returnCopy={\n  en:{title:'Returns, exchanges & refunds',intro:'Send a request for the items you bought. T